#: docs/design/timer-advanced.md:14
msgid ""
"The reviewed STM32F407 datasheet establishes these alternate functions. They "
"do not establish a connector, external load, safe electrical level or PCB "
"revision. External Board facts must authorize the actual route. The main "
"clock is the established fixed SoC profile; dynamic reclocking is "
"unsupported. Constructors verify enabled clock gates, APB timer selection and"
" actual AF fields. They do not measure crystal tolerance."
msgstr ""
"经审阅的 STM32F407 数据手册确认这些复用功能。它们不能证明连接器、外部负载、安全电平或 PCB 修订。实际路线必须由外部 Board "
"事实授权。主时钟使用已确立的固定 SoC profile，不支持动态变频。构造函数验证已启用时钟门、APB 定时器选择与实际 AF 字段，不测量晶振容差。"

#: docs/design/timer-advanced.md:31
msgid ""
"Capture uses four public controls: start, stop, read and state. Start borrows"
" an exact caller-owned ring. An admitted IRQ reads one CCR value, which "
"clears its input capture event flag in hardware, then observes overcapture "
"status. Normal IRQ handling acknowledges only observed overcapture W0C facts;"
" it preserves a new unread edge arriving after the data read. A draining IRQ "
"may discard its observed event without publishing. It publishes at most one "
"value. Consumer read copies one oldest event under a saved incoming interrupt"
" mask. Queue operations use conditional cursor wrap and have no division, "
"scanning or variable-length copy. An observable overcapture or full ring "
"increments a saturating incident counter; old values are never overwritten. "
"Incidents may coalesce edges, so they are not an exact count of physical "
"loss."
msgstr ""
"捕获有 start、stop、read、state 四个公共控制。Start 借用精确调用方环。准入后的 IRQ 读取一个 CCR "
"值，硬件同时清除该输入捕获事件，再观察 overcapture。正常 IRQ 只确认已观察的 overcapture W0C "
"事实，保留数据读取后新到达但未读的边沿。排空中 IRQ 可丢弃已观察事件而不发布，单次最多发布一个值。消费者 read "
"在保存进入掩码下复制最旧事件。队列使用条件 cursor 回绕，无除法、扫描或变长复制。可观察 overcapture 或满环增加饱和 incident "
"计数，旧值永不覆盖。事件可能合并边沿，因此不是精确物理丢失计数。"

#: docs/design/timer-advanced.md:60
msgid ""
"Deadtime uses the actual timer tDTS with CKD zero, independently of PSC. "
"Counts 0–127 encode directly, 128–254 by multiples of two, 256–504 by "
"multiples of eight and 512–1008 by multiples of sixteen. Unrepresentable "
"counts reject; rounding would silently change a safety-relevant physical "
"interval. Every hardware encoding is exercised by the production-register "
"model. The repeated counter, slave clock/gate selection and alternate capture"
" XOR input are cleared and read back during construction, rather than "
"inherited from a prior owner."
msgstr ""
"Deadtime 使用真实 timer tDTS，CKD 为零，独立于 PSC。计数 0–127 直接编码，128–254 为二的倍数，256–504 "
"为八的倍数，512–1008 "
"为十六的倍数。无法表示的计数拒绝；取整会静默改变安全相关物理间隔。生产寄存器模型执行每种硬件编码。构造时清除并读回重复计数器、slave "
"clock/gate 选择及替代捕获 XOR 输入，不继承先前所有者状态。"

#: docs/design/timer-advanced.md:68
msgid ""
"BKIN is enabled in hardware. Automatic output reenabling and irreversible "
"LOCK are never selected. An active physical input or observed break latches "
"software fault and disables master output. Start verifies the unchanged "
"deadtime/clock and break configuration, rechecks pending break before "
"enabling MOE and verifies actual MOE readback; it cannot clear a fault. These"
" software observations do not prove behavior for a physical pulse wholly "
"inside a read/write window. Pulse width, hardware reaction and any required "
"external fault latch are Board/system qualification facts. Stop requires "
"actual MOE, both channel sources, counter and break interrupt withdrawal. A "
"refused write retains responsibility. Explicit clear fault requires disabled "
"outputs, inactive actual BKIN and a successful pending-break acknowledgment. "
"It does not start outputs. Products own power-stage recovery policy."
msgstr ""
"BKIN 在硬件中使能，绝不选择自动重新使能输出或不可逆 LOCK。实际输入有效或观察到 break 时锁存软件故障并关闭主输出。Start 校验不变 "
"deadtime／clock／break 配置，在 MOE 使能前重查 pending break 并校验实际 MOE "
"读回；它不能清故障。软件观察不能证明完全位于读写窗口内的物理脉冲行为。脉宽、硬件响应及所需外部故障锁存是 Board／系统资格事实。Stop 要求实际撤销"
" MOE、两个 channel 源、counter 和 break 中断；拒绝写入保留责任。显式 clear fault 要求输出关闭、实际 BKIN "
"无效且 pending break 确认成功，不启动输出。产品持有功率级恢复策略。"

#: docs/design/timer-advanced.md:81
msgid ""
"The private cold release controls require successful source withdrawal, task "
"event drain and an already-quiescent generated IRQ publisher. They clear only"
" the ended static session under a saved mask. Pins, clocks and vector leases "
"remain with assembly until it explicitly drives and reads back the Board's "
"declared inactive levels, then releases resources. Public stop makes a timer "
"source-withdrawal promise; it does not certify an electrical safety state."
msgstr ""
"私有冷态释放控制要求源撤销成功、任务事件排空及生成 IRQ 发布者已经静止，只在保存掩码下清除已结束静态 "
"session。引脚、时钟和向量租约仍归装配，直到显式驱动并读回 Board 声明的非活动电平后才释放。公共 stop 承诺 timer "
"源撤销，不认证电气安全状态。"

#: docs/design/timer-advanced.md:88
msgid ""
"The maintained GoogleTest/GoogleMock targets compile real production C "
"against locked vendor register layouts. Models provide only MMIO/CPU/clock "
"boundaries, including input capture read-clear, W0C, rejected stores and "
"asynchronous edges and hardware break. Strict ARM compilation and type/object"
" reports are separate evidence. Physical edge rate, ISR latency, noise/filter"
" response, duty/deadtime tolerance, shared-vector load, break reaction time "
"and power-stage safety remain **not executed** until a real station supplies "
"measured results. Nexus makes no safety certification claim."
msgstr ""
"维护中的 GoogleTest/GoogleMock 目标依据锁定厂商寄存器布局编译真实生产 C。模型仅提供 MMIO／CPU／clock "
"边界，含捕获读清、W0C、拒绝写入、异步边沿与硬件 break。严格 ARM 编译和类型／对象报告是独立证据。物理边沿速率、ISR "
"延迟、噪声／过滤响应、duty／deadtime 容差、共享向量负载、break 响应及功率级安全均**未执行**，须真实工位提供测量。Nexus "
"不声明安全认证。"

msgid ""
"Cold assembly owns the clock, pins and IRQ vector before construction and "
"keeps them until stop and publisher quiescence. Its sole immutable "
"configuration defines exact timer clock, integer prescaler, channel, filter "
"or complementary output policy. `exclusive` is explicit authority over the "
"whole timer, including clock-gated peer writers; a disabled register is not "
"proof of absent ownership. The TIM1/TIM8 break vectors are shared with "
"TIM9/TIM12 respectively. Both advanced timers use APB2; the TIM12 peer gate "
"is on APB1. Assembly must reserve the shared resource or supply reviewed "
"static dispatch; a provider never changes the NVIC vector on behalf of a "
"peer. A cold configuration failure must be cleaned up by its acquisition "
"owner before releasing leases or publishing a factory face."
msgstr ""
"冷装配在构造前取得 clock、pin 与 IRQ vector，并保留到 stop 和 publisher 静默。唯一的不可变配置定义精确 timer"
" clock、整数预分频、channel、filter 或互补输出策略。`exclusive` 明确授权独占整个 timer，包含 gate 关闭的 "
"peer writer；寄存器关闭不能证明没有其他 owner。TIM1／TIM8 break vector 分别与 TIM9／TIM12 "
"共享。两个高级定时器使用 APB2，TIM12 peer gate 属于 APB1。装配必须保留共享资源或提供已审静态分派；provider 不代替 "
"peer 修改 NVIC。冷配置失败须由取得资源的 owner 清理，之后才能释放 lease 或发布 factory face。"

msgid "TIM8 CH1 PC6, CH1N PA7, BKIN PA6, AF3"
msgstr "TIM8 CH1 PC6、CH1N PA7、BKIN PA6，AF3"

msgid ""
"Cold cleanup retains the exact full configuration identity through the last "
"pin, IRQ and clock receipt, including a failed pad restore after hot "
"release. Retry cannot substitute another configuration, snapshot storage or "
"timer wrapper. Controller, cold owner, immutable configuration and snapshot "
"ranges must be disjoint before any hardware write. All group outputs must be"
" observed inactive before restoring any pad. Capture additionally retains "
"exact controller identity in its read-only cold configuration, so another "
"timer wrapper cannot restore its pad or disable its gate. C pad facts are "
"shared by cold setup and hot admission. Each mode shares one C cleanup "
"algorithm through static hardware facts; hot controller registers remain "
"compile-time specializations, with bounded channel selection and no scan of "
"other channels. CMake compiles only selected wrappers. No per-instance "
"dispatch table is added."
msgstr ""
"冷态清理在最后一项 pin、IRQ、clock 责任退出前保留精确的完整配置身份，包括热态释放后 pad 恢复失败的情况。重试不能替换配置、快照存储或 "
"timer wrapper。任何硬件写入前，controller、cold owner、不可变配置和快照区域必须彼此分离。恢复任一 pad "
"前，必须观察到同组全部输出为 inactive。捕获的只读冷态配置另保留精确 controller 身份，其他 timer wrapper 不能恢复其 "
"pad 或关闭其 gate。冷态设置与热态准入共用 C pad 事实。每种模式通过静态硬件事实复用一套 C 清理算法；热态 controller "
"寄存器仍为编译期专用实现，通道选择有界，不扫描其他通道。CMake 只编译所选 wrapper，不增加逐实例派发表。"

msgid ""
"Complementary PWM has five public controls: set duty, start, stop, state and"
" clear fault. Period, clock, deadtime, polarity and idle levels are "
"immutable cold facts. The selected CH1/CH2/CH3 pair controls its matching "
"CCR, CCMR byte, CCxE/CCxNE and OISx/OISxN; BKIN and MOE remain controller-"
"wide. Duty stages CCR shadow against that fixed base. Zero and full-period "
"duty remain explicit count boundaries; electrical behavior still requires "
"the reviewed complementary output circuit and physical validation."
msgstr ""
"互补 PWM 有 set duty、start、stop、state、clear fault "
"五个公共控制。period、clock、deadtime、polarity 和 idle level 是不可变冷态事实。所选 CH1／CH2／CH3 "
"输出组控制对应的 CCR、CCMR 字节、CCxE／CCxNE 和 OISx／OISxN；BKIN 与 MOE 仍属于整个 "
"controller。Duty 针对固定时基暂存 CCR shadow。零与完整 period duty "
"保留明确计数边界；电气行为仍需经审互补输出电路与物理验证。"

msgid ""
"One selected channel owns the entire controller. Capture, ordinary PWM and "
"encoder personalities cannot share the same timer; complementary CH4 does "
"not exist. The channel is derived from the reviewed Board route, rather than"
" authored again beside the binding. Controller facts own clocks, vectors and"
" peer claims; channel facts own pads. Static generation writes the channel "
"and fixed connections while C owns every hardware transition. No per-channel"
" worker or controller pool is introduced."
msgstr ""
"一路所选通道独占整个 controller。capture、普通 PWM 和 encoder 不能共享同一 timer；不存在 CH4 "
"互补输出。channel 从经审 Board route 派生，不在 binding 旁重复填写。controller 事实持有 "
"clock、vector 与 peer claim，channel 事实持有 pad。静态生成只写入 channel 和固定连接，所有硬件状态转换由 C"
" 实现。不引入逐通道 worker 或 controller 池。"

msgid "TIM1 CH2 PA9, CH2N PB14, BKIN PB12, AF1"
msgstr "TIM1 CH2 PA9，CH2N PB14，BKIN PB12，AF1"

msgid "TIM1 CH3 PA10, CH3N PB15, BKIN PB12, AF1"
msgstr "TIM1 CH3 PA10，CH3N PB15，BKIN PB12，AF1"

msgid "TIM3 CH1–4: PA6 / PA7 / PB0 / PB1, AF2, 16-bit"
msgstr "TIM3 CH1–4：PA6／PA7／PB0／PB1，AF2，16 位"

msgid "TIM4 CH1–4: PB6 / PB7 / PB8 / PB9, AF2, 16-bit"
msgstr "TIM4 CH1–4：PB6／PB7／PB8／PB9，AF2，16 位"

msgid "TIM5 CH1–4: PA0 / PA1 / PA2 / PA3, AF2, 32-bit"
msgstr "TIM5 CH1–4：PA0／PA1／PA2／PA3，AF2，32 位"

msgid "TIM8 CH2 PC7, CH2N PB0, BKIN PA6, AF3"
msgstr "TIM8 CH2 PC7，CH2N PB0，BKIN PA6，AF3"

msgid "TIM8 CH3 PC8, CH3N PB1, BKIN PA6, AF3"
msgstr "TIM8 CH3 PC8，CH3N PB1，BKIN PA6，AF3"

msgid ""
"The raw capture value is a 16-bit modulo count on TIM3/TIM4 and a full "
"32-bit count on TIM5; state reports that width. `tick_hz` describes its "
"post-prescaler unit. `observed_at` comes from the common monotonic clock at "
"IRQ publication; it is not the edge aperture or a reconstructed absolute "
"hardware timestamp. Hardware filter codes specify the selected silicon "
"sampling/filter policy, not a measured debounce interval. Stop first "
"disables and reads back channel, counter and IRQ sources. Queued events "
"require task drain; a refused detach keeps the ring borrowed and returns "
"BUSY. Successful stop is the final ring access. Failed admission has no "
"retained ring, while the execution owner still checks and cleans any refused"
" hardware-control write before releasing the outer clock/pin/vector lease."
msgstr ""
"原始捕获值在 TIM3／TIM4 上是 16 位模计数，在 TIM5 上保留完整 32 位；state 报告该位宽。`tick_hz` 描述 "
"prescaler 后的单位。`observed_at` 来自 IRQ 发布时的公共单调时钟，不是边沿采样时刻或重建的绝对硬件时间戳。硬件 filter"
" 编码代表所选硅片采样／过滤策略，不是实测消抖间隔。Stop 先关闭并读回 channel、counter 与 IRQ source。队列事件须由 "
"task 排空；拒绝撤回时 ring 继续被借用并返回 BUSY。成功 stop 是最后一次 ring 访问。准入失败不保留 ring，但执行 "
"owner 仍须检查并清理被拒绝的硬件控制写入，然后才能释放外层 clock／pin／vector 租约。"

msgid ""
"The two `tests/contracts/multi_controller_assembly/*timer-channels*.toml` "
"references select three independent capture timers and both advanced timers "
"on F407VE/baremetal and F407ZG/FreeRTOS. They exercise different channels "
"and common break inputs without inventing PCB connections. Ring storage is "
"supplied at capture start, not allocated by platform startup."
msgstr ""
"两份 `tests/contracts/multi_controller_assembly/*timer-channels*.toml` 参考分别在 "
"F407VE／裸机和 F407ZG／FreeRTOS 上选择三个独立捕获 timer 与两个高级 timer，覆盖不同通道和共用 break "
"输入，不虚构 PCB 接线。Ring 存储在 capture start 时由调用方提供，不由 platform startup 分配。"
